					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-288730#post-1335265</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-288730/alone#post-1335265</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Dec 2011 18:09:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>thorgold</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1183797</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like it. As a single story, it's a temporary creep - &quot;Oh, no eyes, primal fear, brr!&quot; A good five-minute story that'll stay with you for another five minutes&#8230;</p> <p>Then you realize, hours later in the dead of night, that something's watching you. And you think back to this story, and you swear under your breath in sheer horror at the revelation.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
